WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.696
Bu qismda ikki real masalani yechamiz.

2
00:00:03.696 --> 00:00:07.704
Birinchisi — choy qachon ichishga tayyor bo‘lishi.

3
00:00:07.704 --> 00:00:14.064
Ikkinchisi — ming kompyuterli tarmoqda virus qachon tarmoqning yarmini egallashi.

4
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:20.280
Ikkalasida ham reja bir xil: modelni yozamiz, o‘zgaruvchilarni ajratamiz,

5
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.478
o‘lchovdan koeffitsiyentni topamiz va savolga javob beramiz.

6
00:00:25.728 --> 00:00:31.776
Nyuton qonuni: sovish tezligi jism va xona harorati farqiga proporsional.

7
00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:36.408
Ya’ni T shtrix teng minus k karra T minus xona harorati.

8
00:00:36.408 --> 00:00:40.464
Minus ishorasi issiq jism soviydi degani.

9
00:00:40.464 --> 00:00:43.200
Ajratib integrallasak,

10
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:51.878
harorat farqi eksponenta bo‘yicha kamayadi: T teng xona harorati plyus boshlang‘ich farq karra e daraja minus k t.

11
00:00:52.128 --> 00:00:59.784
Xona yigirma gradus, choy to‘qson gradusda quyildi, o‘n daqiqadan keyin oltmish gradus bo‘ldi.

12
00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:05.616
Formulaga qo‘yamiz: T teng yigirma plyus yetmish karra e daraja minus k t.

13
00:01:05.616 --> 00:01:10.464
O‘n daqiqada yetmish karra e daraja minus o‘n k qirqqa teng.

14
00:01:10.464 --> 00:01:18.350
Demak, k teng o‘ndan bir karra yetti to‘rtdan logarifmi, taxminan nol butun besh yuz oltmishdan bir.

15
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.392
Endi savol: qachon o‘ttiz gradus bo‘ladi?

16
00:01:22.392 --> 00:01:30.120
Yetmish karra e daraja minus k t o‘nga teng bo‘lishi kerak, ya’ni e daraja minus k t yettidan birga teng.

17
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:37.272
Bundan t teng yettining logarifmi bo‘lingan k ga, taxminan o‘ttiz to‘rt butun sakkiz daqiqa.

18
00:01:37.272 --> 00:01:42.950
Tekshiramiz: yigirma plyus yetmish karra yettidan bir aniq o‘ttiz.

19
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.656
Ikkinchi model: tarmoqdagi virus.

20
00:01:46.656 --> 00:01:55.704
Zararlanish tezligi zararlangan va sog‘ kompyuterlar uchrashuviga proporsional: I shtrix teng beta karra I karra N minus I.

21
00:01:55.704 --> 00:01:58.320
Bu logistik tenglama.

22
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.552
Uning yechimi N bo‘lingan bir plyus A karra e daraja minus r t ga.

23
00:02:03.552 --> 00:02:08.832
Ming kompyuter, boshida o‘nta, bir soatdan keyin ellikta bo‘lsa,

24
00:02:08.832 --> 00:02:13.838
yarmi taxminan ikki butun sakson soatda zararlanadi.

25
00:02:14.088 --> 00:02:18.600
Grafikda zararlangan kompyuterlar soni ko‘rsatilgan.

26
00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:25.032
Boshida o‘sish deyarli eksponensial, keyin egri chiziq burilib, mingga yaqinlashadi.

27
00:02:25.032 --> 00:02:30.720
Burilish nuqtasi aynan besh yuzda — bu paytda virus eng tez tarqaladi.

28
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:36.566
Shuning uchun himoya choralarini burilish nuqtasidan oldin ko‘rish muhim.

29
00:02:36.816 --> 00:02:39.072
Tekshiruv savoli.

30
00:02:39.072 --> 00:02:43.920
Logistik modelda o‘sish eng tez bo‘lgan holatni tanlang.

31
00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:48.782
Eslatma: o‘ng tomon — bu P ga nisbatan parabola.
